{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-shop-hero
  Stage 5 /shop page hero. Editorial latest-mag feature with two states,
  driven by the SAME flag as the shop grid tile badge:

    pre-sale - the NEXT issue (current + 1) has a product flagged
               theinmag.is_pre_order = true. Eyebrow "Pre-sale", headline
               "MagXX is coming", peach Pre-order stamp on the photo.
               Primary CTA pre-orders that issue; secondary CTA points at
               the Membership.
    on-sale  - no pre-order open. Eyebrow "Stocks limited", headline
               "MagXX is officially on sale". Points at the CURRENT issue.
               Primary CTA shops it; secondary CTA "See inside" jumps to the
               PDP #see-inside section.
    sold-out - no pre-order open AND the current issue's Print variant is
               unavailable (real Shopify inventory, so it flips itself the
               moment the last copy sells, overnight included). Eyebrow
               "MagXX print has sold out", headline "Hellooooo MagYY"
               (the issue before), photo = that issue's cover, primary CTA
               shops it, secondary CTA points at the sold-out issue's
               digital edition. No line under the headline (too much
               writing, Ryan). Added 2026-09-04 for the Mag10 sell-out.
               `preview_sold_out` (section setting) forces this state on a
               preview theme; never leave it on for live.

  Metafields read:
    shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_number  -> e.g. "Mag09" (full string)
    product.metafields.theinmag.is_pre_order        -> on the NEXT issue product,
                                                       drives the pre-sale state
    shop.metafields.judgeme.{all_reviews_rating,all_reviews_count} -> aggregate

  New-issue release flow (checklist Step 5 is the single switch):
    - Pre-sale opens: create the next issue's product + set its
      theinmag.is_pre_order = true. The hero CTA links to /products/{handle},
      so that product must exist or the CTA 404s.
    - Drop day: flip the issue's is_pre_order off + update current_issue_number.
      The hero auto-switches to on-sale and the badge follows - no theme edit.
    - Hero photo: section setting hero_image wins; fallback is filename
      pattern hero-shop-{handle}.jpg in /assets/. Swap it per drop via the
      theme editor image picker or by uploading to /assets/.

  Note: the announcement bar still runs its own next_release_date countdown
  (independent of this hero's state).

  Spec: Stage 5 build brief Part 3.1.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_issue = shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_number.value | default: 'Mag09'

  comment
    Derive handles. current_issue is stored as the full "Mag09" string so
    the current product handle is just the lowercase. Next issue is current
    plus 1 with zero-padding so "Mag09" -> next "Mag10", "Mag10" -> "Mag11".
  endcomment
  assign current_handle = current_issue | downcase
  assign current_num_str = current_issue | remove: 'Mag'
  assign current_num = current_num_str | times: 1
  assign next_num = current_num | plus: 1
  if next_num < 10
    assign next_issue = 'Mag0' | append: next_num
    assign next_handle = 'mag0' | append: next_num
  else
    assign next_issue = 'Mag' | append: next_num
    assign next_handle = 'mag' | append: next_num
  endif

  comment
    Two states, driven by the SAME flag as the grid tile badge so the hero
    and the tiles can never disagree:

      pre-sale  - the NEXT issue's product is flagged for pre-order
                  (product.metafields.theinmag.is_pre_order = true). The hero
                  points at that next issue and pushes the pre-order.
      on-sale   - no pre-order is open, so the hero points at the CURRENT
                  issue and pushes the sale.

    The new-issue release checklist Step 5 ("flip pre-sale -> on-sale" +
    update current_issue_number) is the single switch that moves BOTH the
    badge and this hero - no per-drop theme edit needed.
  endcomment
  assign next_product = all_products[next_handle]
  assign next_is_pre_order = false
  if next_product != blank and next_product.id != blank
    assign next_is_pre_order = next_product.metafields.theinmag.is_pre_order | default: false
  endif

  if next_is_pre_order
    assign hero_state = 'presale'
    assign hero_mag = next_issue
    assign hero_handle = next_handle
    assign eyebrow = 'Pre-sale'
    assign headline = hero_mag | append: ' is coming'
    assign primary_label = 'Pre-order ' | append: hero_mag
    assign secondary_label = 'Grab a membership'
    assign secondary_url = '/products/membership'
  else
    assign hero_state = 'onsale'
    assign hero_mag = current_issue
    assign hero_handle = current_handle
    assign eyebrow = 'Stocks limited'
    assign headline = hero_mag | append: ' is officially on sale'
    assign primary_label = 'Shop ' | append: hero_mag
    assign secondary_label = 'See inside'
    assign secondary_url = '/products/' | append: hero_handle | append: '#see-inside'
  endif

  comment
    Pre-sale drop date - the single shop metafield (theinmag.next_release_date,
    YYYY-MM-DD) the shop tile + cart badge read, formatted "15 June". Drives the
    presale-only "Drops ..." line below the headline so the hero states the date
    up front. Update that one metafield each drop and this moves with it.
  endcomment
  assign drop_date = ''
  assign next_release_date = shop.metafields.theinmag.next_release_date.value
  if next_release_date != blank
    assign drop_date = next_release_date | date: '%-d %B'
  endif

  assign subhead = section.settings.subhead | default: '120+ pages of pure creativity. Made by Aussie kids, sustainably printed in Australia.'

  assign primary_url = '/products/' | append: hero_handle
  assign target_product = all_products[hero_handle]

  comment
    Photo source, resolved in priority order:
      1. single_mag.media_images (first image) on the target issue product -
         the data-driven cover, auto-updates each drop. PRIMARY source.
      2. hero_image          - theme editor image picker (manual override)
      3. hero_image_filename  - manual filename of an asset in /assets/
      4. hero-shop-{handle}.jpg - filename convention fallback
    If none resolve the photo pane falls back to the cream background.
  endcomment
  assign metafield_cover = null
  if target_product != blank and target_product.id != blank
    assign media_images = target_product.metafields.single_mag.media_images.value
    if media_images != blank
      assign metafield_cover = media_images | first
    endif
  endif
  assign hero_image = section.settings.hero_image
  assign hero_image_manual = section.settings.hero_image_filename | strip
  assign hero_image_alt = section.settings.hero_image_alt | default: 'theINmag latest issue cover photo.'

  assign hero_image_asset_url = ''
  if hero_image_manual != blank
    assign hero_image_asset_url = hero_image_manual | asset_url
  else
    assign convention_filename = 'hero-shop-' | append: hero_handle | append: '.jpg'
    assign hero_image_asset_url = convention_filename | asset_url
  endif

  comment
    Price line. Reads variants of the target product if it exists in this
    storefront context. Falls back to brand-standard pricing line when the
    product isn't yet created (countdown state for an unreleased mag).
  endcomment
  assign print_price = ''
  assign digital_price = ''
  assign print_available = false
  if target_product != blank and target_product.id != blank
    for v in target_product.variants
      assign vt = v.title | downcase
      if print_price == '' and vt contains 'print'
        assign print_price = v.price | money
        assign print_available = v.available
      elsif digital_price == '' and vt contains 'digital'
        assign digital_price = v.price | money
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  comment
    SOLD-OUT STATE. If we are on-sale but the current issue's Print is gone
    (or the preview override is on), re-point the whole hero at the issue
    before it. Re-resolve the target product, cover and prices for it.
  endcomment
  assign preview_sold_out = section.settings.preview_sold_out | default: false
  if hero_state == 'onsale' and target_product != blank and target_product.id != blank
    if print_available == false or preview_sold_out
      assign prev_num = current_num | minus: 1
      if prev_num < 10
        assign prev_issue = 'Mag0' | append: prev_num
        assign prev_handle = 'mag0' | append: prev_num
      else
        assign prev_issue = 'Mag' | append: prev_num
        assign prev_handle = 'mag' | append: prev_num
      endif
      assign prev_product = all_products[prev_handle]
      if prev_product != blank and prev_product.id != blank
        assign hero_state = 'soldout'
        assign soldout_issue = hero_mag
        assign soldout_handle = hero_handle
        assign hero_mag = prev_issue
        assign hero_handle = prev_handle
        assign eyebrow = soldout_issue | append: ' print has sold out'
        assign headline = 'Hellooooo ' | append: hero_mag
        assign primary_label = 'Shop ' | append: hero_mag
        assign primary_url = '/products/' | append: hero_handle
        assign secondary_label = soldout_issue | append: ' digital'
        assign secondary_url = '/products/' | append: soldout_handle
        assign target_product = prev_product
        assign metafield_cover = null
        assign prev_media_images = target_product.metafields.single_mag.media_images.value
        if prev_media_images != blank
          assign metafield_cover = prev_media_images | first
        endif
        if metafield_cover == blank and target_product.featured_image != blank
          assign metafield_cover = target_product.featured_image
        endif
        assign print_price = ''
        assign digital_price = ''
        assign print_available = false
        for v in target_product.variants
          assign vt = v.title | downcase
          if print_price == '' and vt contains 'print'
            assign print_price = v.price | money
            assign print_available = v.available
          elsif digital_price == '' and vt contains 'digital'
            assign digital_price = v.price | money
          endif
        endfor
      endif
    endif
  endif

  if print_price == ''
    assign print_price = '$23.95'
  endif
  if digital_price == ''
    assign digital_price = '$10.45'
  endif

  comment
    Judge.me aggregate stamp. Hidden until the shop has reviews so we
    never show "0 reviews" - empty-state honesty per Bible Part 11.
  endcomment
  assign jm = shop.metafields.judgeme
  assign jm_rating = jm.all_reviews_rating | default: 0
  assign jm_count = jm.all_reviews_count | default: 0
  assign show_rating = false
  if jm_count != 0 and jm_count != blank
    assign show_rating = true
  endif

  assign section_style = '--tsh-pt: ' | append: section.settings.padding_top | append: 'px; --tsh-pb: ' | append: section.settings.padding_bottom | append: 'px;'
-%}

<section
  class="theinmag-shop-hero"
  data-theinmag-shop-hero
  data-hero-state="{{ hero_state }}"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-shop-hero-heading"
  style="{{ section_style }}"
>
  <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__inner">

    {%- comment -%} LEFT pane (desktop) / TOP (mobile): hero photo {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__photo">
      {%- if metafield_cover != blank -%}
        <img
          class="theinmag-shop-hero__image"
          src="{{ metafield_cover | image_url: width: 1400 }}"
          srcset="{{ metafield_cover | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ metafield_cover | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w, {{ metafield_cover | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w, {{ metafield_cover | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
          sizes="(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw"
          alt="{{ metafield_cover.alt | default: hero_image_alt | escape }}"
          width="1400"
          height="1400"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      {%- elsif hero_image != blank -%}
        <img
          class="theinmag-shop-hero__image"
          src="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}"
          srcset="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
          sizes="(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw"
          alt="{{ hero_image_alt | escape }}"
          width="1400"
          height="1400"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          class="theinmag-shop-hero__image"
          src="{{ hero_image_asset_url }}"
          alt="{{ hero_image_alt | escape }}"
          width="1400"
          height="1400"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        >
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if hero_state == 'presale' -%}
        <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp" aria-label="Pre-order open">Pre-order</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if hero_state == 'soldout' -%}
        <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp--instock" aria-label="{{ hero_mag }} in stock">In stock now</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} RIGHT pane (desktop) / BOTTOM (mobile): copy {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__copy">
      {%- if section.settings.show_character -%}
        {% render 'theinmag-character-pool' %}
        <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__character" data-theinmag-pool-character></span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow{% if hero_state == 'soldout' %} theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow--bold{% endif %}">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      <h1 id="theinmag-shop-hero-heading" class="theinmag-shop-hero__headline">{{ headline }}</h1>
      {%- if hero_state == 'presale' and drop_date != blank -%}
        <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__drops">Drops {{ drop_date }}. Pre-order now, ships on release day.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__subhead">{{ subhead }}</p>

      {%- if show_rating -%}
        <a href="#theinmag-reviews-heading" class="theinmag-shop-hero__rating" data-rating-jump aria-label="Read {{ jm_count }} customer reviews across our printed mags">
          <span data-score="{{ jm_rating }}" class="jdgm-all-reviews-rating" aria-label="{{ jm_rating | round: 1 }} stars" role="img"></span>
          <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__rating-meta">{{ jm_rating | round: 1 }} - {{ jm_count }} reviews across our printed mags</span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- unless section.settings.show_price_ctas == false -%}
      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__price">{{ print_price }} print - {{ digital_price }} digital</p>

      <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__ctas">
        {%- comment -%}
          data-format-intent makes the PDP open on Print (the customer can
          still toggle to Digital). The single-mag PDP remembers the last
          Print/Digital pick in sessionStorage; the script below sets that to
          Print on click so this CTA always lands on the printed edition.
          Only set when Print is actually buyable - if it's sold out we let
          the PDP fall back to its own default (Digital).
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <a class="theinmag-shop-hero__cta theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary" href="{{ primary_url }}"{% if print_available %} data-format-intent="Print"{% endif %}>{{ primary_label }}</a>
        <a class="theinmag-shop-hero__cta theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary" href="{{ secondary_url }}">{{ secondary_label }}</a>
      </div>
      {%- endunless -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  (function () {
    var cta = document.querySelector('[data-theinmag-shop-hero] [data-format-intent]');
    if (!cta) return;
    cta.addEventListener('click', function () {
      try {
        sessionStorage.setItem('theinmag.activeFormat', cta.getAttribute('data-format-intent'));
      } catch (e) {}
    });
  })();
</script>

{%- comment -%}
  Page-level JSON-LD for /shop. Three nodes:
    BreadcrumbList - Home -> Shop
    CollectionPage - the /shop page itself
    ItemList       - the latest mag featured here (full grid ItemList is the
                     shop-grid section's responsibility once that ships).
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ shop.url | json }}},
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Shop", "item": {{ shop.url | append: '/pages/shop' | json }}}
    ]
  }
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "name": "Shop",
    "description": "Shop the latest theINmag - kid-created, ad-free, sustainably printed in Australia.",
    "url": {{ shop.url | append: '/pages/shop' | json }}
  }
</script>

{%- comment -%}
  ItemList JSON-LD is emitted by theinmag-shop-grid below this section
  with the full product list. Don't duplicate it here.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- stylesheet -%}
  .theinmag-shop-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    padding: var(--tsh-pt, 0) 0 var(--tsh-pb, 0);
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    /* Mobile: photo on top, copy beneath. Total section height grows
       organically from content. */
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      min-height: clamp(560px, 75vh, 800px);
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Photo pane ---------- */

  .theinmag-shop-hero__photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__photo {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: clamp(560px, 75vh, 800px);
    }
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Pre-order stamp - peach pill, top-right corner of photo. Soft shadow
     so it lifts off the photo without competing. Only rendered in the
     pre-sale state (see the Liquid above). */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--space-md);
    right: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-peach, #FCDDB8);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.15);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp--instock {
    background-color: var(--color-mint, #D6EAD9);
  }

  /* ---------- Copy pane ---------- */

  .theinmag-shop-hero__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Optional kid-character peek (schema-toggled). Sits in the blank space
     above the eyebrow, top-right of the copy column. Desktop only. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__character {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__character {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      top: clamp(8px, 2vw, 28px);
      right: clamp(72px, 11vw, 200px);
      width: clamp(92px, 8vw, 124px);
      z-index: 2;
    }
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-coral-dark, #C9543E);
  }
  /* Sold-out state: the eyebrow carries the news, so it reads bold (Ryan,
     2026-09-04) and the explanatory line under the headline is gone. Sits
     AFTER the base rule on purpose: equal specificity, source order wins. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow--bold {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Pre-sale drop-date line - sits under the headline so the release date is
     stated up front (transparency: buyers know it ships on release day, not
     now). Coral-dark bold to read as a clear factual note, not a CTA. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__drops {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-coral-dark, #C9543E);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__headline {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__subhead {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.85;
    /* Wide enough to keep the countdown subhead on one line on desktop;
       still wraps on narrow viewports as the font + column scale down. */
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Aggregate rating - sits just under the subhead, links to #reviews. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating .jdgm-all-reviews-rating {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

  /* Price line - subdued, between rating and CTAs. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__price {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.7vw, 17px);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  /* CTAs - primary yellow sticker (locked convention) + outlined secondary. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 20px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), color var(--transition-standard), translate var(--transition-standard), box-shadow var(--transition-standard);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-yellow);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark);
    color: #ffffff;
    translate: 0 2px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-pressed);
    outline: none;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    outline: none;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:hover {
      translate: 0 0;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
    }
  }
{%- endstylesheet -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shop hero",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section theinmag-shop-hero-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
